                  "text": "Ezek 8.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Uhereye mu rukenyerero rwacyo ukerekeza haruguru, mbona hafite ibara nk'iry'umuringa ukūbye, umuriro ukizingurije ku mubiri wacyo, kandi uhereye mu rukenyerero ugasubiza hepfo, nabonye hasa n'umuriro no mu mpande zacyo harabagirana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
